# Conventional Commits: feat|fix|docs|refactor|test|chore|ci(scope): summary
#
# Body: what changed and why. Call out anything unverified or deferred.
#
# Maintainer commits credit all three owners — delete the two that are not you.
# These are the GitHub noreply forms on purpose: they resolve to the account
# whatever its email-privacy setting is, and they keep personal addresses out of
# a public history.

